---@field storedProcedureParameters? any Value and type setting for stored procedure parameters. Example: "{Parameter1: {value: "1", type: "int"}}".
---@field isolationLevel? any Specifies the transaction locking behavior for the SQL source. Allowed values: ReadCommitted/ReadUncommitted/RepeatableRead/Serializable/Snapshot. The default value is ReadCommitted. Type: string (or Expression with resultType string).
---@field produceAdditionalTypes? any Which additional types to produce.
