---@field authenticationType any The authentication type to connect to Common Data Service for Apps server. 'Office365' for online scenario, 'Ifd' for on-premises with Ifd scenario. 'AADServicePrincipal' for Server-To-Server authentication in online scenario, 'Active Directory' for Dynamics on-premises with IFD. Type: string (or Expression with resultType string).
