---HDInsight ondemand linked service properties.
---@class azure.datafactory.HDInsightOnDemandLinkedServiceTypeProperties
---@field clusterSize any Number of worker/data nodes in the cluster. Suggestion value: 4. Type: int (or Expression with resultType int).
---@field timeToLive any The allowed idle time for the on-demand HDInsight cluster. Specifies how long the on-demand HDInsight cluster stays alive after completion of an activity run if there are no other active jobs in the cluster. The minimum value is 5 mins. Type: string (or Expression with resultType string).
---@field version any Version of the HDInsight cluster.  Type: string (or Expression with resultType string).
---@field linkedServiceName azure.datafactory.LinkedServiceReference Azure Storage linked service to be used by the on-demand cluster for storing and processing data.
---@field hostSubscriptionId any The customer’s subscription to host the cluster. Type: string (or Expression with resultType string).
---@field servicePrincipalId? any The service principal id for the hostSubscriptionId. Type: string (or Expression with resultType string).
---@field servicePrincipalKey? azure.datafactory.SecretBase The key for the service principal id.
---@field tenant any The Tenant id/name to which the service principal belongs. Type: string (or Expression with resultType string).
---@field clusterResourceGroup any The resource group where the cluster belongs. Type: string (or Expression with resultType string).
---@field clusterResourceGroupAuthType? azure.datafactory.HDInsightOndemandClusterResourceGroupAuthenticationType|string HDInsight On-demand cluster resource group authentication type.
---@field clusterNamePrefix? any The prefix of cluster name, postfix will be distinct with timestamp. Type: string (or Expression with resultType string).
---@field clusterUserName? any The username to access the cluster. Type: string (or Expression with resultType string).
---@field clusterPassword? azure.datafactory.SecretBase The password to access the cluster.
---@field clusterSshUserName? any The username to SSH remotely connect to cluster’s node (for Linux). Type: string (or Expression with resultType string).
---@field clusterSshPassword? azure.datafactory.SecretBase The password to SSH remotely connect cluster’s node (for Linux).
---@field additionalLinkedServiceNames? azure.datafactory.HDInsightOnDemandLinkedServiceTypePropertiesAdditionalLinkedServiceNamesList Specifies additional storage accounts for the HDInsight linked service so that the Data Factory service can register them on your behalf.
---@field hcatalogLinkedServiceName? azure.datafactory.LinkedServiceReference The name of Azure SQL linked service that point to the HCatalog database. The on-demand HDInsight cluster is created by using the Azure SQL database as the metastore.
---@field clusterType? any The cluster type. Type: string (or Expression with resultType string).
---@field sparkVersion? any The version of spark if the cluster type is 'spark'. Type: string (or Expression with resultType string).
---@field coreConfiguration? any Specifies the core configuration parameters (as in core-site.xml) for the HDInsight cluster to be created.
---@field hBaseConfiguration? any Specifies the HBase configuration parameters (hbase-site.xml) for the HDInsight cluster.
---@field hdfsConfiguration? any Specifies the HDFS configuration parameters (hdfs-site.xml) for the HDInsight cluster.
---@field hiveConfiguration? any Specifies the hive configuration parameters (hive-site.xml) for the HDInsight cluster.
---@field mapReduceConfiguration? any Specifies the MapReduce configuration parameters (mapred-site.xml) for the HDInsight cluster.
---@field oozieConfiguration? any Specifies the Oozie configuration parameters (oozie-site.xml) for the HDInsight cluster.
---@field stormConfiguration? any Specifies the Storm configuration parameters (storm-site.xml) for the HDInsight cluster.
---@field yarnConfiguration? any Specifies the Yarn configuration parameters (yarn-site.xml) for the HDInsight cluster.
---@field encryptedCredential? string The encrypted credential used for authentication. Credentials are encrypted using the integration runtime credential manager. Type: string.
---@field headNodeSize? any Specifies the size of the head node for the HDInsight cluster.
---@field dataNodeSize? any Specifies the size of the data node for the HDInsight cluster.
---@field zookeeperNodeSize? any Specifies the size of the Zoo Keeper node for the HDInsight cluster.
---@field scriptActions? azure.datafactory.HDInsightOnDemandLinkedServiceTypePropertiesScriptActionsList Custom script actions to run on HDI ondemand cluster once it's up. Please refer to https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/hdinsight/hdinsight-hadoop-customize-cluster-linux?toc=%2Fen-us%2Fazure%2Fhdinsight%2Fr-server%2FTOC.json&bc=%2Fen-us%2Fazure%2Fbread%2Ftoc.json#understanding-script-actions.
---@field virtualNetworkId? any The ARM resource ID for the vNet to which the cluster should be joined after creation. Type: string (or Expression with resultType string).
---@field subnetName? any The ARM resource ID for the subnet in the vNet. If virtualNetworkId was specified, then this property is required. Type: string (or Expression with resultType string).
---@field credential? azure.datafactory.CredentialReference The credential reference containing authentication information.

