---@class azure.datafactory.OraclePartitionSettings
---@field partitionNames? any Names of the physical partitions of Oracle table.
---@field partitionColumnName? any The name of the column in integer type that will be used for proceeding range partitioning. Type: string (or Expression with resultType string).
---@field partitionUpperBound? any The maximum value of column specified in partitionColumnName that will be used for proceeding range partitioning. Type: string (or Expression with resultType string).
